    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="22">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 22</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sy ælc getreowe man ðe tihtbysi nǽre ⁊ naðer ne burste ne að ne ordal innan hundrede anfealde lade wyrðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every trustworthy man, who has never earned a bad reputation and who has never failed either in oath or in ordeal, shall be entitled to clear himself within the hundred by the simple oath or exculpation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sy [ælc getrywa man, þe tihtbysig] nære, ⁊ naðor ne burste ne að ne ordal, innan hundrede anfealdre lade wyrðe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
